# Normalise line endings across the team.
#
# Members work on different operating systems, and Windows checkouts were
# rewriting these files to CRLF. Two things break when that happens:
#
#   .githooks/pre-commit  — a shell script with CRLF fails on macOS and Linux
#                           with "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M", so the secret
#                           scan silently stops protecting those machines.
#   .claude/agents/*.md   — YAML frontmatter delimiters are matched literally,
#                           and "---\r" is not "---".
#
# Everything textual is stored and checked out with LF.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
